#----------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# kingbase_mysql_type.dat
#    Kingbase MySQL-compatible type metadata overlay.
#
#    The generator builds a MySQL-mode table with its own mysql_type_gen::Inner
#    variants. This file only carries Kingbase MySQL-specific entries; the
#    small set of shared wire-compatible builtins is selected explicitly in
#    codegen instead of cloning the PostgreSQL table wholesale.
#
#----------------------------------------------------------------------

